  "limitations": [
    "Exterior is dated to September 1917, when the photo-documented timber vestibule, balcony and enclosure were in place. The dated view represents the documented internment period.",
    "Historic placement uses the extant masonry outline and original river-town grade. Finish colors, pent roof detailing, rear windows, street fencing and small fittings are approximate."
  ],
  "sourceLicense": "Original model based on the mapped mansion, independently dated National Library of Russia and U.S. Library of Congress prints, and the UCLA Library’s 1929 Longmans plate.",
